    {
      "ordinal": 60,
      "label": "coach_teacher_head_battleend_lose_00_00",
      "hash64": "44600B37F799571F",
      "text": "What a fiery battle that was! I may have emerged\\nas victor, but it could have fallen either way.\\c\\nThe key is in how we choose to handle defeat...\\nbut I believe you know this well enough already.[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
